    <section id="how" className="landing-intro"><div className="intro-tag">A BETTER CAMPUS SIGNAL</div><div><h2>Less searching.<br /><em>More showing up.</em></h2><p>CampusConnect brings the right information out of scattered chats and onto one dependable campus noticeboard—organized by what matters to you.</p><Link href="/sign-up" className="text-link">See what’s happening <ArrowRight size={16} /></Link></div><div className="intro-decoration">CC<span>●</span></div></section>
