    <section className="landing-callout"><div className="callout-pattern" /><div className="callout-content"><span className="eyebrow">GOOD THINGS HAPPEN HERE</span><h2>Be where it’s<br /><em>happening.</em></h2><p>Start with a clearer view of campus.</p><Link href="/sign-up" className="button button-cream button-large" data-testid="link-sign-up-bottom">Get connected <ArrowRight size={17} /></Link></div><span className="callout-stamp">CAMPUS<br />CONNECT<br /><small>EST. NOW</small></span></section>
